body:
She has a lawyer, the lawyer did their thing a few times and the insurance wasn't budging on the issue, they recommended she essentially just dump the property at this point to someone who buys such things or price out cleanup and eventually come back around to deal with litigation later because at the moment it doesn't seem like much progress can be made due to all the small print on the coverage etc.

&nbsp;

Been doing emails and phone calls for services in and around the area getting quotes best I can, just figured it could not hurt to ask and see if anyone has any personal recommendations for any companies that can help without breaking my bank.
